{"suttaId":"an8.75","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-viii","vriCode":"s0404m1.mul","paras":[910,918],"vripara":"75"},"segments":{"an8.75:0.3":"Paṭhamasampadāsuttaṃ","an8.75:1.1":"“Aṭṭhimā, bhikkhave, sampadā.","an8.75:1.2":"Katamā aṭṭha?[a. ni.8.54] Uṭṭhānasampadā, ārakkhasampadā, kalyāṇamittatā, samajīvitā, saddhāsampadā, sīlasampadā, cāgasampadā, paññāsampadā – imā kho, bhikkhave, aṭṭha sampadā”ti.","an8.75:2.1":"“Uṭṭhātā kammadheyyesu, appamatto vidhānavā;","an8.75:2.3":"Samaṃ kappeti jīvikaṃ, sambhataṃ anurakkhati.","an8.75:3.1":"“Saddho sīlena sampanno, vadaññū vītamaccharo;","an8.75:3.3":"Niccaṃ maggaṃ visodheti, sotthānaṃ samparāyikaṃ.","an8.75:4.1":"“Iccete aṭṭha dhammā ca, saddhassa gharamesino;","an8.75:4.3":"Akkhātā saccanāmena, ubhayattha sukhāvahā.","an8.75:5.1":"“Diṭṭhadhammahitatthāya, samparāyasukhāya ca;","an8.75:5.3":"Evametaṃ gahaṭṭhānaṃ, cāgo puññaṃ pavaḍḍhatī”ti.","an8.75:5.5":"pañcamaṃ;"},"attha":null,"tika":null}
